n the function \n$f(x;w)={w}_{1}{x}_{1}-{w}_{2}{x}_{2}+{w}_{3}{x}_{3},$\ncompute ${∇}_{w}\\,f$ with the input $x={[\\begin{aligned}-1,\\,-2,\\,4\\end{aligned}]}^{T}.$\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\" rowspan=\"3\" width=\"30px\">${∇}_{w}\\,f=\\text{ }$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"35px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "To compute ${∇}_{w}\\,f$, we take partial derivatives with respect to each component of $w.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂{w}_{1}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{w}_{1}}({w}_{1}{x}_{1}-{w}_{2}{x}_{2}+{w}_{3}{x}_{3})={x}_{1} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{w}_{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{w}_{2}}({w}_{1}{x}_{1}-{w}_{2}{x}_{2}+{w}_{3}{x}_{3})=-{x}_{2} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{w}_{3}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂{w}_{3}}({w}_{1}{x}_{1}-{w}_{2}{x}_{2}+{w}_{3}{x}_{3})={x}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, with $x={[\\begin{aligned}-1,\\,-2,\\,4\\end{aligned}]}^{T},$ we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}\\,f & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-fa7c0dcc-df23-50fe-ae24-12a55f715bfc" "answer-field-32606a0e-d412-54f9-b88b-46f91f22715a" "answer-field-8d5827b7-8650-5441-839c-9a5f22f87096"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-fa7c0dcc-df23-50fe-ae24-12a55f715bfc" :answer-field/id #uuid "fa7c0dcc-df23-50fe-ae24-12a55f715bfc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answ